{{Skill|Combat}} is one of the core player [[Skills]] in SkyBlock. It can be leveled up by killing mobs, claiming Combat [[Minion]] drops, claiming [[Bestiary]] milestones, and a multitude of other methods. The maximum level {{Skill|Combat}} can go up to is {{Skill|Combat 60}}.

== Overview ==
{{Skill|Combat}} XP is gained from killing mobs: each mob grants a set amount of XP when killed, with the exception of mobs spawned on the [[Private Island]], which do not grant XP on kill.

The amount of {{Skill|Combat}} XP gained on mob kill increases with {{Stat|Combat Wisdom}}. {{Stat|Combat Wisdom}} can be increased through numerous different methods, such as using different weapons and armor that grant {{Stat|Combat Wisdom}}, equipping [[Pets]] that grant {{Stat|Combat Wisdom}}, or syphoning the {{Item|Apex Dragon Shard}}.

