== Warrior Bonus ==
By leveling up your {{Skill|Combat}} skill, you gain a passive '''Warrior''' bonus. For every level from {{Skill|Combat 1}} to {{Skill|Combat 50}}, all {{Stat|dmg}} against mobs is increased by {{Green|4%}}: {{Skill|Combat 51}} to {{Skill|Combat 60}} grants {{Green|+1%}} {{Stat|dmg}} instead.

